Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I still don't know why I'm here。Couldn't you just make them say yes？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I could，but it's not my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I would expect you，of all people，would understand my feelings on misuse of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，power corrupts and all that。Yes，I know，Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- When are you going to stop lecturing me？- When you start listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're here because I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't have to meet every one of them in person？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.30,0:01:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。This one's special.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a beautiful campus。John，don't you think？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，the brochure is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what about Jean？What about her illness？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- lllness？- John.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think your daughter is sick，Mr。Grey？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps it would be best if we were to speak to her。Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean，can you come down，dear？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll leave you，then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's very rude to read my thoughts，or Mr。Lensherr's，without our permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you think you were the only one of your kind，young lady？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're mutants，Jean。We're like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Really？I doubt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have more power than you can imagine，Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The question is，will you control that power？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or let it control you？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Warren？Son，is everything all right？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What's going on？- Nothing。I'll be right out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。You've been in there for over an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open the door。Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,One second！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me in there right now。Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not you。- Dad，I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The whole world's going to hell and you're just going to sit there？Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bobby！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're getting killed out here。- Yeah，I know。They're not ready，Storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Logan。- Oh，don't get your panties in a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was my last cigar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's getting closer。- Come on。Let's keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Tin Man。Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How's your throwing arm？- Logan，we work as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Good luck with that。Throw me。Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dammit，Logan，don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Class dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Colossus。Nice throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Simulation complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What was that？- Danger room session.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You know what I mean。- Lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't change the rules。I'm trying to teach 'em something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I taught 'em something。- It was a defensive exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，best defense is a good offence。Or is it the other way round？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This isn't a game，Logan。- Well，you sure fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I'm just a sub。You got a problem，talk to Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Scott！- Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scott。Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you OK？- I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seem like you're avoiding me。Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't touch my boyfriend without killing him。Other than that I'm wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。I don't think that's fair。Have I ever put any pressure on you？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're a guy，Bobby。Your mind's only on one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They were looking for you。You didn't show。- What do you care？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- For starters，I had to cover your ass。- I didn't ask you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you didn't。The professor did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I was just passing through。- So pass through，Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I know how you feel。When Jean died… - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe it's time for us to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not everybody heals as fast as you，Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mr。Secretary。- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The meeting's begun，sir。- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mr。President.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have a seat，Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Homeland Security was tracking Magneto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got hits in Lisbon，Geneva，Montreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,NAVSAT lost him crossing the border，but we did get a consolation prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We picked her up breaking into the FDA.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know who she's been imitating？Secretary Trask here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir。She can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Not any more，she can't。We got her。- You think your prisons can hold her？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have some new prisons。We'll keep them mobile。Be a step ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is Magneto？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Raven？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Raven，I asked you a question。- I don't answer to my slave name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Raven Darkholme。That's your real name，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or has he convinced you you don't have a family any more？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,My family tried to kill me，you pathetic meat sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，then。Mystique，where is he？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,In here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to play games with you。I want answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't want to play games with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are going to stop this。Tell me，where is Magneto？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna know where he is？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Homo sapien.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，her capture will only provoke Magneto，
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,but having her does give us some diplomatic leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,On principle，I can't negotiate with these people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I thought that's why you appointed me，sir。- Yes，it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But that's not why you called me here。- No。This is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's what she stole from the FDA.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dear Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Is it viable？- We believe it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You realize the impact this'll have on the mutant community？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。I do。That's precisely why we need some of your diplomacy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,When an individual acquires great power，
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,the use or misuse of that power is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will it be for the greater good or will it be used for personal or for destructive ends？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，this is a question we must all ask ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why？Because we are mutants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,For psychics，this presents a particular problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,When is it acceptable to use our power and when do we cross that invisible line
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,that turns us into tyrants over our fellow man？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,But Einstein said that ethics are an exclusive human concern
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,without any superhuman authority behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Einstein wasn't a mutant so far as we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,This case study was sent to me by a colleague，Dr。Moira McTaggert。Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The man you see here was born with no higher-level brain functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,His organs and nervous system work，but he has no consciousness to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if we were to transfer the consciousness of one person，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,say a father of four with terminal cancer，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,into the body of this man？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are we to decide what falls within the range of ethical behavior and what…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Professor？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll continue this tomorrow。Class dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:14:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,The forecast was for sunny skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have to be psychic to see that something's bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't understand。Magneto's a fugitive，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,we've a mutant in the cabinet，a president who understands us，why hide？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're not hiding。But we still have enemies。I must protect my students。You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，but we can't be students forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Storm，I haven't thought of you as my student for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,In fact，I thought that perhaps you might take my place some day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But Scott's… - Scott's a changed man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,He took Jean's death so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，things are better out there，
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.30,0:14:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you，of all people，know how fast the weather can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:15:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something you're not telling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hank？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ororo。Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love what you've done with your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You too。Thank you for seeing me on such short notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Henry，you are always welcome here。You're a part of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I have news。- Is it Eric？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.80,0:15:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Though we have been making some progress on that front.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Mystique was recently apprehended。- Who's the fur ball？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hank McCoy。Secretary of Mutant Affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right，right。The secretary。Nice suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Henry，this is Logan。He's… - Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I hear you're quite an animal。- Look who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magneto's gonna come get Mystique.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magneto's not the problem。At least not our most pressing one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A major pharmaceutical company has developed a mutant antibody.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A way to suppress the mutant X gene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Suppress？- Permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're calling it a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous。You can't cure being a mutant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.30,0:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Scientifically speaking… - When did we become a disease？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're announcing it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,These so-called mutants are people just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their affliction is nothing more than a disease，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,a corruption of healthy cellular activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I stand here today to tell you that there's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.70,0:16:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,This site，once the world's most famous prison，
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,will now be the source of freedom for all mutants who choose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I proudly present the answer to mutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finally，we have a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who would want this cure？I mean，what kind of coward would take it just to fit in？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is it cowardice to save oneself from persecution？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not all of us can fit in so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You don't shed on the furniture。- The government probably cooked this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- The government had nothing to do with it。- I've heard that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,My boy，I have been fighting for mutant rights since before you had claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did he just call me boy？- Is it true？They can cure us？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Rogue。It appears to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,They can't cure us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wanna know why？Because there's nothing to cure。Nothing's wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or any of us，for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,How should we，as mutants，respond？Here's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:18:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is about getting organized。Bringing our complaints to the right people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to put together a committee and talk to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.70,0:18:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,They don't understand。They don't know what it means to be a mutant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,We need to show them，educate them，let them know that we're here to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,People，you must listen。They won't take us seriously…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They wanna exterminate us。- This cure is voluntary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.60,0:18:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody is talking about extermination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one ever talks about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,They just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you'll go on with your lives ignoring the signs all around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then one day，when the air is still and the night has fallen，they come for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then you realize，while you're talking about organizing and committees，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,the extermination has already begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make no mistake，my brothers。They will draw first blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,They will force their cure upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only question is，will you join my brotherhood and fight？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or wait for the inevitable genocide？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who will you stand with？The humans？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Or us？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You talk pretty tough for a guy in a cape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.70,0:19:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're so proud of being a mutant，where's your mark？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have been marked once，my dear。Let me assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,No needle shall ever touch my skin again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know who you're talking to？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.30,0:19:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what can you do？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,So you have talents？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:20:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,That and more。I know you control metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I know there's 87 mutants in here，none above a class three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.30,0:20:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Other than you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can sense other mutants and their powers？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could you locate one for me？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me out of here。I demand that you release me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know who I am？I'm the president of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Mr。President.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this to me？Let me down。I'll be a good girl。Please let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep it up。I'll spray you in the face，bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I get out of here，I'm going to kill you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Secretary McCoy，welcome to Worthington Labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，Dr。Rao。Not an easy place to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the safest location we could find。That's why we keep the source of the cure here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is a mutant。You understand our concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We are in compliance with your policy。- How long will you keep the boy here？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.80,0:22:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until we can fully map his DNA。We can replicate it，but we can't generate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,And his power？What is its range？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's someone I would like you to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello there，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi。- My name is Hank McCoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.90,0:22:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have an amazing gift。Thank you，Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.80,0:22:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Extraordinary，isn't he？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.80,0:23:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.90,0:23:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.60,0:23:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.40,0:23:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you hear me？I'm still here。Scott。- Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.60,0:24:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm here。Scott。Scott。- Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.20,0:24:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Scott。Scott。- Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need you，Scott。Scott。Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.10,0:25:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.50,0:25:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,How？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.90,0:25:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.60,0:25:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wanna see your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.80,0:25:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Take these off。- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.90,0:25:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Trust me。I can control it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.80,0:25:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open them。You can't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.40,0:26:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What happened？- No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.40,0:26:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Professor，are you OK？- Get to Alkali Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.50,0:27:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You don't want to be here。- Do you？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.90,0:27:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't see a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.40,0:27:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.00,0:28:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.30,0:28:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Logan！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.00,0:28:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.30,0:28:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.30,0:28:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The sheer mass of water that collapsed on top of Jean should have obliterated her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.70,0:29:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The only explanation of Jean's survival
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.00,0:29:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,is that her powers wrapped her in a cocoon of telekinetic energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.10,0:29:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is she gonna be OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.80,0:29:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean Grey is the only class five mutant I've ever encountered，her potential limitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.60,0:29:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her mutation is seated in the unconscious part of her mind and therein lay the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.40,0:29:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,When she was a girl，I created a series of psychic barriers
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.00,0:29:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,to isolate her powers from her conscious mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.70,0:29:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jean developed a dual personality。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.80,0:29:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The conscious Jean，whose powers were always in her control，and the dormant side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.90,0:29:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A personality that，in our sessions，came to call itself the Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.50,0:29:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,A purely instinctual creature，all desire and joy and rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.80,0:29:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She knew all this？- It's unclear how much she knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:30:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Far more critical is whether the woman in front of us is the Jean Grey we know，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,or the Phoenix furiously struggling to be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.70,0:30:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She looks peaceful to me。- I'm keeping her that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.80,0:30:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trying to restore the psychic blocks and cage the beast again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.40,0:30:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What have you done to her？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.90,0:30:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You have to understand… - You're talking about a person's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.50,0:30:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She has to be controlled。- Controlled？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.70,0:30:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sometimes，when you cage the beast，the beast gets angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.20,0:30:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have no idea。You have no idea of what she is capable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.50,0:30:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Professor。I had no idea what you were capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.60,0:30:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had a terrible choice to make。I chose the lesser of two evils.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.40,0:30:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It sounds to me like Jean had no choice at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.40,0:30:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have to explain myself，least of all to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.90,0:30:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,History will be made here today。For the first time，
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.60,0:31:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,the so-called mutant cure will be available to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.10,0:31:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Reaction has run the gamut with mutants on both sides of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.50,0:31:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some are desperate for this cure while others are offended by the very idea of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will Secretary McCoy be a problem？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.20,0:31:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hard to say。His political views seem somewhat at odds with his personal issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.50,0:31:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，sir。Your son's arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.30,0:31:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good。Bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.30,0:31:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to start with him？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.60,0:31:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it's important。Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.70,0:31:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hello，Warren。- How are you，son？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.10,0:31:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Did you sleep well？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.70,0:31:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I'm proud of you for doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.60,0:31:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be fine。I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.70,0:32:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You ready？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.10,0:32:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The transformation can be a little jarring.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.10,0:32:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dad，can we talk about this for a second？- We've talked about it，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.80,0:32:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll all be over soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.10,0:32:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Everything's going to be fine。- Wait。I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Warren，calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.90,0:32:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can't do this。- Yes，you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.10,0:32:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can't do this。- Just relax，son。Take it easy。Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.30,0:33:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I promise you it will be fine。Warren，relax。- Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.20,0:33:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Warren，it's a better life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.40,0:33:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- It's what we all want。- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.10,0:33:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.40,0:33:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Warren，no！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.70,0:34:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Told you so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.20,0:34:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,About time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.00,0:34:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been busy。Did you find what you were looking for？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.60,0:35:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,The source of the cure is a mutant。A child at Worthington Labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.50,0:35:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Without him，they have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.30,0:35:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Read off the guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.60,0:35:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Cell 41205。James Madrox.」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.80,0:35:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,This one robbed seven banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.90,0:35:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- At the same time。- I could use a man of your talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.00,0:35:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm in。- Welcome to the Brotherhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.10,0:35:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Careful with this one。- 「Cain Marko。Solitary confinement.」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.50,0:35:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check this out。「Prisoner must be confined at all times.」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「lf he builds any momentum，no object can stop him.」
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.10,0:35:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,How fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.10,0:35:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do they call you？- Juggernaut.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I can't imagine why。- Are you going to let me out？I need a pee.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.60,0:36:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Nice helmet。- Keeps my face pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.70,0:36:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he'll make a fine addition to our army.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.70,0:36:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.60,0:36:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.90,0:36:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.00,0:36:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.90,0:36:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're not one of us any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.10,0:37:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Such a shame。She was so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.30,0:37:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Think resigning will make a difference？That's no way to influence policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.30,0:37:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Policy is being made without me，Mr。President.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.00,0:37:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,The decision to turn the cure into a weapon was made without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.30,0:37:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened on that convoy was inexcusable。But your actions…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.10,0:37:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was an isolated incident。You have to understand those mutants were a real threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.50,0:37:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you even begun to think what a slippery slope you're on？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.90,0:37:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.70,0:37:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I worry about how democracy survives when one man can move cities with his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.80,0:37:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,As do l.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.20,0:37:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You and I know that it's only going to get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.90,0:37:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,All the more reason why I need to be where I belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.90,0:38:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.10,0:38:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hi，Logan。- Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.00,0:38:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Back where we first met。Only I was in your place and you were in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.60,0:38:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.40,0:38:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.70,0:38:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,More than OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.80,0:39:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Logan，you're making me blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.00,0:39:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're reading my thoughts？- I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.80,0:39:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.00,0:39:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.80,0:40:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait。- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.90,0:40:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.70,0:40:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This isn't you。- Yes，it is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.80,0:40:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Maybe you ought to take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.20,0:40:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,The professor said you might be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.90,0:40:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He would know，wouldn't he？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.40,0:40:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？You think he's not in your head too？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.30,0:40:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at you，Logan。He's tamed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.30,0:40:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where's Scott？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.70,0:41:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.80,0:41:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where am l？- You're in the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.20,0:41:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need to tell me what happened to Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.70,0:41:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean，tell me what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.30,0:41:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，God.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.60,0:41:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.60,0:41:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay with me。Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.10,0:41:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Look at me。Look at me。- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.10,0:41:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Focus。Focus，Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.70,0:41:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.60,0:41:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What？- Kill me before I kill someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.40,0:42:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Don't say that。- Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stop it。- Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.90,0:42:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop it。Look at me。Look at me。Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.30,0:42:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be all right。We can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.50,0:42:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey。The professor can help。He can fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.60,0:42:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't want to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.90,0:42:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Voluntary？They put the cure in a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.10,0:42:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you they would draw first blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.40,0:42:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So what do we do？- What do we do？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.00,0:42:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We use this weapon as a lightning rod to bring countless more to our cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.60,0:42:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come。We have an army to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.50,0:42:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I picked something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.60,0:42:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,An electromagnetic force。It's massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.90,0:42:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a mutant.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.50,0:43:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Class five。More powerful than anything I've ever felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.70,0:43:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,More powerful than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.20,0:43:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is she？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.70,0:43:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.20,0:43:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Jean。Jean。- What happened？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.40,0:43:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,What have you done？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.00,0:43:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I think she killed Scott。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.80,0:43:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- That's not possible。- I warned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.50,0:43:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's left the mansion，but she's trying to block my thoughts。She's so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.00,0:43:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It may be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.70,0:43:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Wait for me here。- What？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.60,0:43:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need to see Jean alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.40,0:43:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You were right，Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.70,0:44:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This one is special。- What the hell are you doing here？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.10,0:44:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Same as the professor。Visiting an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.20,0:44:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I don't want trouble here。- Nor do l.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.60,0:44:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，shall we go inside？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.00,0:44:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I came to bring Jean home。Don't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.60,0:44:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Just like old times，eh？- She needs help。Jean is not well.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.80,0:44:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Funny，you sound just like her parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.70,0:44:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nobody gets inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.90,0:45:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I knew you'd come。- Of course。I've come to bring you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.20,0:45:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I have no home。- Yes，you do。You have a home and a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.10,0:45:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know he thinks your power is too great for you to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.80,0:45:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe your mind games are going to work any more，Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.80,0:45:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- So you want to control me？- He does.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.80,0:45:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。I want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.60,0:45:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me？What's wrong with me？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.30,0:45:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Absolutely nothing。- Eric，stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.20,0:45:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Charles，not this time。You've always held her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.40,0:45:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,For your own good，Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.60,0:45:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.00,0:45:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm going in。- The professor said he'd handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.00,0:46:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at me，Jean。I can help you。Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.00,0:46:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.80,0:46:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Perhaps you should listen to her，Charles。- Trust me。You're a danger to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.70,0:46:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- But I can help you。- I think you want to give her the cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.20,0:46:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at Scott。You killed the man you loved because you couldn't control your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.50,0:46:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Stop it！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.30,0:46:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.50,0:47:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean，let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.60,0:48:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.50,0:48:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.40,0:49:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't let it control you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.80,0:49:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.30,0:50:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,My dear。Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.80,0:50:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.10,0:50:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,God！
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.70,0:50:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,We live in an age of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.90,0:51:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,A world full of fear，hate and intolerance.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.50,0:51:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,But in every age，there are those who fight against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.90,0:51:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charles Xavier was born to a world divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.20,0:51:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,A world he tried to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.60,0:51:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,A mission he never saw accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It seems the destiny of great men to see their goals unfulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.50,0:51:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charles was more than a leader，more than a teacher。He was a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.50,0:51:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,When we were afraid，he gave us strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.00,0:51:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,And when we were alone，he gave us a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.60,0:51:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,He may be gone，but his teachings live on through us，his students.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.70,0:51:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wherever we may go，we must carry on his vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.30,0:51:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that's a vision of a world united.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.50,0:52:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.40,0:52:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.30,0:52:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You OK？- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.50,0:52:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just… Xavier came to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.10,0:52:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was the one that convinced me to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.90,0:52:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.10,0:52:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We're all feeling the same way，you know。- No，Bobby，we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.40,0:52:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You have Rogue and I have…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.40,0:52:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I just miss home.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.20,0:52:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The first snow and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.10,0:53:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Kitty，get up。Come with me。- Storm told us to stay in our rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.50,0:53:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。We won't get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.20,0:53:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I mean，you can walk through walls，you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.90,0:53:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.50,0:53:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This place can be home too.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.10,0:54:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you for this，Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.40,0:54:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You need a lift，kid？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.60,0:54:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.70,0:54:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.30,0:54:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know what it's like to be afraid of your powers，afraid to get close to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.10,0:54:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.60,0:54:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to be able to touch people，Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.30,0:54:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,A hug。A handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.90,0:54:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.00,0:54:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope you're not doing this for some boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.30,0:55:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，if you wanna go，then go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.60,0:55:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just be sure it's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.80,0:55:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be telling me to stay？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.60,0:55:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,To go upstairs and unpack？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.80,0:55:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not your father。I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.20,0:55:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just think about what I said，Rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.20,0:55:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.00,0:55:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.10,0:56:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember when we first met？Do you know what I saw when I looked at you？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.60,0:56:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw the next stage in evolution both Charles and I dreamt of finding.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.10,0:56:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And I thought to myself，「Why would Charles want to turn this goddess into a mortal？」
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.00,0:56:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can manipulate the metal in this，
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.00,0:56:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,but you，you can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.60,0:56:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anything you can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.50,0:56:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.70,0:56:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.70,0:56:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.60,0:56:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You sound just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.90,0:57:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean，he wanted to hold you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.00,0:57:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What do you want？- I want you to be what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.90,0:57:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,As nature intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.90,0:57:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,That cure is meant for all of us。If we want freedom，we must fight for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.40,0:57:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,And that fight begins now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.30,0:57:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,She shouldn't be here with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.10,0:57:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Her power is completely unstable。- Only in the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.00,0:57:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- And you trust her？She's one of them。- So were you once.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.60,0:57:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I stuck with you。Would have killed the professor if you'd given me the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.60,0:57:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charles Xavier did more for mutants than you'll ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.70,0:57:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,My single greatest regret is that he had to die for our dream to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.50,0:58:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,So what now？What do we do？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.50,0:58:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Xavier started this school。Perhaps it's best that it end with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.20,0:58:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We'll tell the students they're going home。- Most of us don't have anywhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.20,0:58:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe this。I can't believe we're not going to fight for this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.00,0:58:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry。I know this is a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.80,0:58:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I was told that this was a safe place for mutants.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.20,0:58:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It was，son.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.00,0:58:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it still is。We'll find you a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.30,0:58:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hank，tell all the students the school stays open.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.30,0:59:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.20,0:59:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.50,0:59:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hey，Pete。Have you seen Rogue？- Yeah，she took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.10,0:59:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.50,0:59:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.10,0:59:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Logan。- Jean？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.60,0:59:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Logan。Where am l？Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.10,0:59:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Logan。Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.00,0:59:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Logan。- Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.40,0:59:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Logan。Logan。Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.60,1:00:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are you going？- Where do you think？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.40,1:00:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's gone，Logan。She's not coming back。- You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.40,1:00:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,She killed the professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.90,1:00:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It wasn't Jean。The Jean I know is still in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.10,1:00:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，why can't you see the truth？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.70,1:00:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Why can't you just let her go？- Because… because…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.50,1:00:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Because you love her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.40,1:00:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,She made her choice。Now it's time we make ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.30,1:00:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,So if you're with us，then be with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.80,1:01:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need a cure！We don't need a cure！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.10,1:01:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need a cure！We don't need a cure！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.60,1:01:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need a cure！We don't need a cure！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.70,1:01:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need a cure！We don't need a cure！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.60,1:01:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Getting the cure so you can go back home to mommy and daddy？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.30,1:01:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.10,1:01:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，I get it。Your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.60,1:01:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I figured she'd want the cure。She's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.80,1:01:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，lceman.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.50,1:01:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make a move.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.90,1:02:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Same old Bobby。Still afraid of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.90,1:02:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Today's attack was only our first salvo.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.30,1:02:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,So long as the cure exists，our war will rage.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.30,1:02:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your cities will not be safe。Your streets will not be safe。You will not be safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.80,1:02:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,And to my fellow mutants，I make you this offer…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.80,1:02:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Join us or stay out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.70,1:02:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enough mutant blood has been spilled already.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.10,1:02:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're trying to track them，sir。We're working hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.60,1:02:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- We cannot let him do this。- You know I agree，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.70,1:02:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is now a national security matter。Seize and secure Worthington Labs.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.00,1:02:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want troops armed with cure weapons deployed immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.70,1:03:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,And Trask，you have to find Magneto and stop him by any means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.00,1:03:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Magneto wants a war。We'll give him one.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.40,1:03:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go。Keep it moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.10,1:03:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn in your old weapon。Turn in all metal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.90,1:03:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bayonets，magazines，dog tags.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.60,1:03:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pick up your plastic weapons。Pick up your cure cartridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.80,1:03:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Absolutely no metal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.00,1:03:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need a cure！We don't need a cure！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.70,1:03:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need a cure！We don't need a cure！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.80,1:03:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need a cure！We don't need a cure！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.80,1:06:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,They wish to cure us。But I say to you we are the cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.30,1:06:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,The cure for that infirm，imperfect condition called homo sapiens.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.50,1:06:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,They have their weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.60,1:06:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.70,1:06:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will strike with a vengeance and a fury that this world has never witnessed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.40,1:06:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if any mutants stand in our way，we will use this poison against them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.60,1:06:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We shall go to Alcatraz lsland，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.30,1:06:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,take control of the cure，
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.60,1:06:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,and destroy its source.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.10,1:06:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,And then nothing can stop us.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.00,1:07:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.40,1:07:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know the smell of your adamantium from a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.70,1:07:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I didn't come here to fight you。- Smart boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.70,1:07:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I came for Jean。- You think I'm keeping her against her will？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.00,1:07:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- She's here because she wants to be。- You don't know what you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.00,1:07:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know full well。I saw what she did to Charles.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.80,1:08:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,And you stood there and let him die？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.30,1:08:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I'm not leaving here without her。- Yes，you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.40,1:08:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.40,1:08:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Two minutes till rendezvous，Mr。President.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.30,1:08:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a satellite feed of Magneto's base of operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.20,1:08:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- How did we find it？- She gave us everything we wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.00,1:08:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hell hath no fury like a woman scorned.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.30,1:09:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Approaching target dead ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.20,1:09:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Set for 360-degree incursion.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.00,1:09:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Team Leader to Bravo One。We are green to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.20,1:09:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK，send them in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.50,1:09:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.90,1:09:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Freeze，mutants！Get your hands in the air！Hands in the air！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.80,1:10:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK。I give up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.40,1:10:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry，Mr。Secretary，it was a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.90,1:10:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,If he's not there，then where the hell is he？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.00,1:10:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Worthington Labs。It ends where it began.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.40,1:10:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 100% - Are you sure the boy is still inside？- 100%.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.80,1:10:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,So how are we supposed to get there？'Cause I don't swim.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.20,1:10:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave that to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.30,1:10:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Storm。Storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.60,1:10:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing back here？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.40,1:10:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need help.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.60,1:10:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You found her。- Yeah。She's with Magneto.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.50,1:10:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are they？- On the move。I know where they're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.40,1:11:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- You're saying you saw Magneto？- We gotta go。They're gonna attack Alcatraz.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.90,1:11:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- There are troops stationed on that island。- Not enough to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.40,1:11:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's suit up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.70,1:11:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Hard to believe this once fit me。- If Magneto gets that cure，we can't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.90,1:11:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Can you estimate how many he has？- An army。And Jean.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.00,1:11:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- His powers have limits，hers do not。- There's only six of us，Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.30,1:11:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。We're outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.80,1:11:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.50,1:11:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we lost Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.00,1:11:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We lost the professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.20,1:11:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we don't fight now，everything they stood for will die with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.90,1:11:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.20,1:11:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.40,1:11:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then we stand together.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.70,1:11:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,X-Men.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.20,1:11:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,All of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.80,1:12:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.30,1:12:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.40,1:12:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- They're ready。- Yeah，I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.50,1:12:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,But are you ready to do what you need to do when the time comes？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.80,1:13:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dad，what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.60,1:13:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's an earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.20,1:13:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.00,1:16:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charles always wanted to build bridges.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.50,1:16:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,My God.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.80,1:16:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fall back！Take cover！Fall back！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.60,1:17:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,The boy's in the southeast corner of the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.70,1:17:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Well，then。- Let's take it down！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.80,1:17:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,In chess，the pawns go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.30,1:17:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Humans and their guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.80,1:17:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Plastic。They've learned.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.80,1:17:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's why the pawns go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.20,1:18:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Target the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.50,1:18:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fire！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.10,1:18:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Arclight，use your shockwaves。Target those weapons.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.70,1:18:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，my stars and garters。- Go into stealth mode.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.30,1:19:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- What about jets？Tanks？- Against Magneto？He'll turn them inside out.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.50,1:19:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Where are our ground troops？- 30 minutes away.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.10,1:19:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then God help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.00,1:19:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're coming for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.00,1:19:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't ever do that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.80,1:20:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You men cover the doors！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.10,1:20:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody get together！And hold this line！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.10,1:20:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Traitors to their own cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.10,1:20:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Finish them！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.00,1:21:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.40,1:21:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go inside and get the boy。And kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.20,1:21:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.10,1:21:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold it！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.70,1:21:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's going for the boy！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.80,1:21:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not if I get there first.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.20,1:21:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kitty！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.50,1:22:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.80,1:22:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Grow those back.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.40,1:22:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you know who I am？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.40,1:22:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm the Juggernaut，bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.90,1:22:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Going somewhere？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.50,1:23:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're the guy that invented the cure，right？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.20,1:23:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.10,1:23:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.90,1:23:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Don't。Don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.30,1:23:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- No。Don't hurt him。- Let go of me。I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.70,1:23:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Calm down。Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.00,1:23:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.30,1:23:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- I thought you were a diplomat。- As Churchill said，「There comes a time…」
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.40,1:23:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，you get the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.10,1:23:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no。Please，no，no，don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.30,1:23:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.80,1:24:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，don't worry。I'm here to help you。I'm going to get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.00,1:24:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.30,1:24:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Oh，my God。What's going on？- Your powers won't work with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Stay close，all right？- OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.70,1:24:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm the wrong guy to play hide-and-seek with.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.10,1:24:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's hiding，dickhead？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.10,1:24:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't。No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.80,1:24:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.70,1:24:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Please，don't do this。I only wanted to help you people.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.30,1:24:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do we look like we need your help？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.70,1:25:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's time to end this war.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.60,1:25:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.00,1:25:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.20,1:25:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Let's go，let's go。- Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.90,1:25:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go！Go！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.10,1:26:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We work as a team.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.20,1:26:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Best defense is a good offence.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.90,1:26:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bobby，think you can take out your old friend？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.20,1:27:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.50,1:27:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Storm，we're gonna need some cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.10,1:27:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.70,1:28:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're in over your head，Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.90,1:28:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you should go back to school.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.80,1:28:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You never should have left.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.20,1:28:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.50,1:28:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.60,1:28:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Make it a strike.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.20,1:28:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You never learn，do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.40,1:28:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.40,1:29:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.70,1:29:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,One of them？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.40,1:29:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is what they want for all of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.80,1:29:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's over，Jean.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.20,1:29:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.40,1:29:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Don't shoot！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.90,1:30:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.40,1:30:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Everybody get out of there！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.90,1:30:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bobby！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.10,1:30:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,What have I done？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.00,1:31:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can stop her。Get everyone to safety.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.40,1:31:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.50,1:31:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.40,1:32:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jean！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.60,1:32:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know you're still there！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.50,1:32:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You would die for them？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.30,1:33:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.60,1:33:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.60,1:33:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.60,1:33:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Save me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.60,1:33:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.60,1:35:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're back.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.50,1:35:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.20,1:35:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I had to.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.00,1:35:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- This isn't what I wanted。- I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.10,1:35:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.90,1:35:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.50,1:35:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good to see you，buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.90,1:35:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,With the thanks of a grateful nation
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.70,1:35:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I introduce our new ambassador to the United Nations，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.00,1:35:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the representative to the world for all United States citizens，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.20,1:35:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,human and mutant alike，
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.20,1:35:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dr。Hank McCoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.40,1:35:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Way to go，fur ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.30,1:43:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.70,1:43:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，Moira.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.80,1:44:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:08.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（二十年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不明白要我来干吗？ 你就不能直接让他们答应？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然能，但那不是我的作风
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.30,0:01:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我希望你，跟其他所有人 能理解我对滥用超能力的立场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要用超能力干坏事 我都知道了，查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你啥时能别总教育我了？ - 你也得听啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你来是因为我需要你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.50,0:01:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不用每一个都亲自拜访吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.30,0:01:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用，但这个很特别
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,校园环境真好啊 约翰，你说呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，介绍很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但琴怎么办？ 她的病怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 病？ - 约翰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你女儿有病，葛雷先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:01:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好能让我们单独跟她谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴，下楼来好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你们谈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.10,0:02:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,擅自监听我们的思想是很不礼貌的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.10,0:02:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为就你会特异功能吗，小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是变种人，琴 我们跟你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？我不太想信
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的超能力远强于此，琴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.90,0:03:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是，你能控制它
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.40,0:03:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是被它控制？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:23.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（十年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃伦，儿子，你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 没什么，我马上出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，你都进去快一个小时了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门，沃伦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃伦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻让我进去，开门
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不该 - 爸爸，对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.50,0:05:10.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《X战警3：背水一战》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:20.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（不远的未来）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.00,0:05:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人间都快成地狱了，你们还干坐着？ 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.40,0:06:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了，基蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们死定了 - 对，我知道，他们没准备好呢，暴风女
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洛根 - 哦，别大惊小怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我最后一根雪茄
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.10,0:06:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 越来越近了 - 快点，快闪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，铁樵夫，过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胳膊没生锈吧？ - 洛根，我们该并肩作战
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，祝君好运了，扔我上去，快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:06:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，洛根，别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,下课
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，巨匠，扔得好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,仿真结束
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那算什么？ - 危情演习
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白我指什么 - 别当回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.30,0:07:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能坏了规矩 我正试图教他们些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经教了 - 那该是防御练习
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，进攻就是最好的防守
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.60,0:07:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是游戏，洛根 - 那你还真骗到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，我就是个代课的 你有意见，找斯科特说去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.00,0:08:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯科特！ - 琴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.50,0:08:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特 斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.30,0:08:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像是总在躲着我 有啥不对劲的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了一碰我男朋友他就会挂掉 我几近完美
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，这不公平 我给过你压力吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是男的，鲍比 你脑子里只有一根筋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们正找你呢，你没去上课 - 你瞎操什么心？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 首先，我得替你收拾残局 - 我可没求你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是没有，但教授有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是路过 - 那就赶紧过，洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.90,0:09:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我理解你的感受，琴死的时候… - 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候该重新振作了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人像你一样好得那么快，洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（变种人事务部）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,（《科学美国人》 变种人探秘）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 部长先生 - 什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会议开始了，先生 - 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧，汉克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,国土安全部正在追踪万磁王
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追查到里斯本，日内瓦，蒙特利尔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,卫星在他过境的时候跟丢了 但我们有个安慰奖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在她闯入FDA时逮到的 （FDA：美国食品及药物管理局）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜她当时变成谁了？ 就是崔萨克部长本人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确，她能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以后就不行了，我们抓到她了 - 你认为你的监狱能关住她？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有新型监狱 这次要先发制人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.30,0:10:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,万磁王在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.30,0:10:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞文
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 瑞文，我在问你话 - 我不叫这种奴隶名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞文·达克霍姆 那是你的真名，不对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他让你相信你没有家人了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人想杀了我 你个可怜的大草包
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，魔形女，他在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想跟你在这玩游戏 我要答案
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想跟我玩游戏？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别变了 告诉我万磁王在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道他在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,智人（人类的学名）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到她只会激怒万磁王
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她的确是个重要筹码
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.40,0:11:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,按理说，我不跟这些人谈条件
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.40,0:11:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还以为您为此才委任我 - 是，没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.90,0:11:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这不是你叫我来的原因 - 不，这才是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她从FDA偷的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这能行吗？ - 我们相信能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,您知道这会在变种人中造成多大的反响？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道，所以我才找你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.20,0:12:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一个个体获得了超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.20,0:12:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否正确使用它才是关键
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是学雷锋还是谋私利 抑或是搞破坏？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.00,0:12:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些我们都该扪心自问
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.80,0:12:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？因为我们是变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,心理学上，这是一个微妙的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.60,0:12:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,何时可以使用超能力 而何时我们又会失控
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为凌驾于同伴之上的暴君？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但爱因斯坦说，伦理观念
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不牵扯超能力的人文关怀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码现在据我们所知 爱因斯坦不是变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.30,0:13:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个案例分析是默瑞亚·迈克泰格寄来的 琼斯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们见到的这个人， 天生没有高级脑功能
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的各器官跟神经系统正常 但他没有说话的意识
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能把别人的意识
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如一个癌症末期，有四个孩子的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,移植到这个人身上？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何界定这种行为 是否符合伦理道德，而什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明天再继续 下课
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:14:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气预报说今天艳阳高照
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用透视你的思想， 我就能看出来你的烦恼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.40,0:14:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白，万磁王是个逃犯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在内阁里有个变种人 总统也理解我们，干嘛要躲？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是躲，但敌人还是存在 我必须保护我的学生，你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.90,0:14:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，但我们不能做一辈子学生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风女，我早就不把你当学生看了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上，我打算以后让你来 接替我的位子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但斯科特的… - 斯科特变了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.40,0:14:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把琴的死看得太重
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.10,0:14:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，现在外面形势好些了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.30,0:14:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你，你们所有人， 知道这世事有多无常
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:15:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事你没告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥拉若，查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的新发型
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的也不错 谢谢你这么快就来见我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利，这里永远欢迎你 你是这里的一分子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有个消息 - 是埃里克？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.80,0:15:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，但那方面也有些进展
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 魔形女最近被捕了 - 这毛球是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.70,0:15:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克·麦考伊，变种人事务部部长
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，对，部长大人，西装不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亨利，这是洛根，他是… - 金刚狼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听说你绝对是个禽兽 - 彼此彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,万磁王会营救魔形女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,万磁王不是问题 至少不是最棘手的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有家医药公司研发出了一种 变种人抗体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以抑制住变种Ｘ基因
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.00,0:16:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抑制？ - 永久的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们叫它解药
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真荒唐 做变种人是无药可解的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.30,0:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从科学上讲… - 我们什么时候成疾病了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风女
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正在开发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些所谓的变种人 与你我毫无二致
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的痛楚有如疾病一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是细胞恶化造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今日我站在这里是想告诉你们 还有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.70,0:16:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里，曾是世界闻名的监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今将它成为一个自由之源， 帮助那些想恢复正常的变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们，先生们…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在此自豪的向大家介绍 治愈变种的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于，我们有解药了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会想要这解药？ 哪个胆小鬼会为了融入社会用这玩意？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,从迫害中解救自己也叫胆小？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.00,0:17:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有人都能轻松融入的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是站着说话不腰疼 - 这也许只是政府编出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这一切与政府无关 - 这话我以前听过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子，你还没爪子的时候 我就开始捍卫变种人权了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他刚管我叫小子？ - 是真的吗？他们能治好我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，小淘气，看来是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，教授
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.00,0:17:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不能治愈我们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道为什么？因为没什么 好治愈的，你根本就没毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.30,0:17:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都没有毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为变种人，我们该如何回应？ 我是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.80,0:18:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该团结起来 将诉求告知当权者
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.10,0:18:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该成立一个委员会 与政府谈判
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.70,0:18:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不明白，他们不知道 作为变种人的意义
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.90,0:18:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要展现给他们，教育他们 让他们知道，我们想保持现状
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸位，你们必须听着 他们不会重视我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要灭绝我们 - 接受治疗是自愿的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.60,0:18:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人说过什么灭绝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没人会去说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们直接就做了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就这样继续苟且偷生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早有一天，当夜幕降临 他们会来找你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候你才会意识到 当你还在谈论组织委员会时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.20,0:18:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭绝行动早已展开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:18:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别犯错误，兄弟们 他们会先挑起事端
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会强迫我们接受治疗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是 你愿意加入我的兄弟会并肩战斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是等待必将来临的大灭绝？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拥护谁？人类？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿得这么严实，话倒是很露骨啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.70,0:19:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你如此为变种人骄傲 那你的标记呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被标记过一次，亲爱的 我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不允许别人再这么干了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在跟谁说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.60,0:19:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.30,0:19:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么能耐？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的天赋？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.90,0:20:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不止这个，我知道你能控制金属
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还知道这里有87个变种人， 都达不到三级
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.30,0:20:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你们俩之外
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能感知其他变种人跟他们的能力？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能帮我去找个人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我出去 我命令你放了我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.40,0:20:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我是谁？ 我是美国总统
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，总统大人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这样对我？放我下来 我会做个乖孩子，放了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再废话，我就往你脸上喷这个 小贱货
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我出去了 一定亲手杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈考伊部长 欢迎来沃星顿实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，娆博士 来这可不容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是能找的最安全的地方 所以把解药的药方存在这
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个变种人，你明白我们的顾虑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们一直遵照您的政策 - 你要把那孩子关多久？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.80,0:22:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们绘制出他全部的DNA 我们只能复制，但不能制造
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.90,0:22:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他的能力，属于哪一级？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.40,0:22:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉米
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.20,0:22:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我介绍你认识个人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 我叫汉克·麦考伊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.90,0:22:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有个很神奇的才能，谢谢，吉米
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.80,0:22:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天赋异禀，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.80,0:23:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.90,0:23:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.60,0:23:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.40,0:23:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能听见我吗？我一直在这，斯科特 - 住嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.60,0:24:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在这，斯科特，斯科特 - 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.20,0:24:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯科特，斯科特 - 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.00,0:24:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你，斯科特，斯科特，斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.20,0:25:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.10,0:25:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.50,0:25:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.90,0:25:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.60,0:25:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看看你的眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.80,0:25:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 摘掉它 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.90,0:25:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我，我能控制它
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.80,0:25:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁开，你不会伤到我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.40,0:26:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.40,0:26:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 教授，你还好吗？ - 快去奥克莱湖
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.50,0:27:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不想来 - 你想？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.90,0:27:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我啥都看不见
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.40,0:27:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来解决这雾
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.00,0:28:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.30,0:28:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.00,0:28:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没死
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.30,0:28:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.30,0:28:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,速降的水流本应另她 粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.70,0:29:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴之所以能存活下来
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.00,0:29:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只可能是她的能量为她 做了一个像茧子般的异能保护层
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.10,0:29:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会没事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.80,0:29:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴·葛雷是我遇到的唯一一个 五级变种人，她的能量是无限的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.60,0:29:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的突变存在于潜意识中 而且埋下了危险隐患
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.40,0:29:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她还是孩子时， 我制造了一系列精神屏障
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.00,0:29:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来把她的力量与意识隔绝开
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.70,0:29:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以琴发展成了双重人格 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.80,0:29:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,清醒的琴，力量总由她所支配 而那个处于休眠状态的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.90,0:29:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,人格，我们称之为凤凰
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.50,0:29:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯粹的人类本性，充满欲望、享乐和愤怒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.80,0:29:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她知道这些？ - 不清楚她知道多少
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:30:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是面前这个是 我们所熟知的琴·葛雷
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是强烈渴望自由的凤凰
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.70,0:30:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看她挺安详的 - 是我让她这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.80,0:30:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正试图重建精神屏障 将兽性困于其中
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.40,0:30:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对她作了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.90,0:30:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你应该理解… - 你是在说一个人的头脑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.50,0:30:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她需要被控制住 - 控制住？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.70,0:30:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候，物极必反
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.20,0:30:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法想象 你无法想像她能做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.50,0:30:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，教授 我无法想象你能做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.60,0:30:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须作个可怕的选择 我从两个恶魔中选择了危害最小的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.40,0:30:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来是琴别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.40,0:30:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要为自己辩解 你自己来分辨吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.90,0:30:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是历史性的一刻 首次
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.60,0:31:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓的变种人解药 将公之于众
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.10,0:31:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种人两派声势都很强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.50,0:31:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人求药若渴， 而其他人则对此气愤异常
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈考伊部长那边会有麻烦吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.20,0:31:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难说，他的政见与他本人一样怪异
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.50,0:31:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下，先生，您儿子到了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.30,0:31:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，带他进来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.30,0:31:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想从他开始？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.60,0:31:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这很重要，是的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.70,0:31:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好，沃伦 - 怎么样，儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.10,0:31:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 睡得好吗？ - 还行
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.70,0:31:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很骄傲你能参加
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.60,0:31:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好的，我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.70,0:32:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.10,0:32:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,转变过程可能会有些不适
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.10,0:32:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸，我们能再谈谈吗？ - 我们已经谈过了，儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.80,0:32:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快就会过去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.10,0:32:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切都会好的 - 等等，我不能这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.90,0:32:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃伦，别激动
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.90,0:32:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能这么做 - 你能
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.10,0:32:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不能这么做 - 放松点，孩子，别紧张，冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.30,0:33:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我保证会没事的，沃伦，放松 - 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.20,0:33:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃伦，那将是更好的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.40,0:33:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是我们所期望的 - 不是
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.10,0:33:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你所期望的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.40,0:33:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃伦，别！
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.70,0:34:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说啥来着
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.20,0:34:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺准时啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.00,0:34:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直很忙， 找到你要找的东西了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.60,0:35:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药的配方是一个变种人 一个沃星顿实验室里的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.50,0:35:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了他，他们一无是处
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.30,0:35:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,读读乘客名单
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.60,0:35:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,41205单元，詹姆斯·迈罗克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.80,0:35:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙打劫了七家银行
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.90,0:35:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 同时同刻 - 我能用到你的天赋
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.00,0:35:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 算我一个 - 欢迎加入兄弟会
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.10,0:35:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心这家伙 - “科因·马可，单独隔离”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.50,0:35:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听这个：“囚犯必须永久隔离”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.60,0:35:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,“一旦发力，将所向匹敌”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.10,0:35:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,太刺激了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.10,0:35:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们叫你什么？ - 神像
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.20,0:35:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想不出原因 - 你能让我出去吗？我要尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.60,0:36:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 头盔不错 - 我戴着很帅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.70,0:36:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他会令我军实力大增
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.70,0:36:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.60,0:36:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.90,0:36:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃里克
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.00,0:36:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.90,0:36:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再是我们的一员了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.10,0:37:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是丢人，她原来多美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.30,0:37:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你辞职就能管用吗？ 这是动摇不了政策的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.30,0:37:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没参与制定政策，总统先生
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.00,0:37:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,将解药制成武器没经我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.30,0:37:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,押运车队的事的确不能原谅 但您的行动…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.10,0:37:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一次孤立事件 你该清楚那些变种人相当危险
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.50,0:37:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就一点没想过你这是铤而走险？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.90,0:37:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想过
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.70,0:37:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还担心当超能力泛滥时 还有民主可谈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.80,0:37:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也担心
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.20,0:37:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我都知道它只会变得更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.90,0:37:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然我该回到属于我的地方去了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.90,0:38:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.10,0:38:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨，洛根 - 欢迎回来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.00,0:38:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到我们初次见面的地方 你中有我 我中有你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.60,0:38:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.40,0:38:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.70,0:38:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.80,0:39:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根，你让我难为情
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.00,0:39:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在透视我的思想 - 我不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.80,0:39:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.00,0:39:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.80,0:40:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.90,0:40:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.70,0:40:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是你 - 是，是我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.80,0:40:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你该冷静一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.20,0:40:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授说你可能会不同
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.90,0:40:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会知道，是不是？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.40,0:40:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你不觉得他在监视你？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.30,0:40:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你自己，洛根，他驯服了你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.30,0:40:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯科特在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.70,0:41:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.80,0:41:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在哪儿？ - 你在学校
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.20,0:41:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得告诉我斯科特怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.70,0:41:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴，告诉我他怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.30,0:41:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.60,0:41:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.60,0:41:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持清醒，跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.10,0:41:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着我，看着我 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.10,0:41:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中精力，集中精力，琴
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.70,0:41:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.60,0:41:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 在我杀别人前先杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.40,0:42:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别那样说 - 求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别说了 - 杀了我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.90,0:42:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说了，看着我，看着我，琴
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.30,0:42:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的，我们能帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.50,0:42:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，教授能帮你，他能治好你
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.60,0:42:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想治
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.90,0:42:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,自愿？他们把解药装在抢里？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.10,0:42:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说他们会先挑起事端
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.40,0:42:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们怎么办？ - 我们怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.00,0:42:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以此为借口， 血债血偿，加倍奉还
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.60,0:42:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，我们要建立一支军队
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.50,0:42:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现个东西
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.60,0:42:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个电磁能场，很殷实
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.90,0:42:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.50,0:43:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,五级 比我之前感觉到的都强大
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.70,0:43:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你都强大
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.20,0:43:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.70,0:43:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.20,0:43:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琴，琴 - 发生什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.40,0:43:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.00,0:43:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我认为他杀了斯科特 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.80,0:43:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不可能 - 我警告过你
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.50,0:43:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,她离开了学校，但她试图 屏蔽我的意念，她很强大
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.00,0:43:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.70,0:43:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在这等我 - 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.60,0:43:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要单独去见琴
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.40,0:43:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的，查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.70,0:44:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这一个很特别 - 你他妈在这干吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.10,0:44:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟教授一样，拜访老友
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.20,0:44:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想在这生事 - 我也不想
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.60,0:44:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，我们进去吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.00,0:44:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来带琴回家，别妨碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.60,0:44:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就像上次，嗯？ - 她需要帮助，她情况不好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.80,0:44:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣，你的口气就像她父母
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.70,0:44:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让任何人进来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.90,0:45:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你会来 - 当然，我来带你回家
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.20,0:45:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有家 - 你当然有，你有家跟家人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.10,0:45:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得你的能力对你来说太强了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.80,0:45:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意念游戏不管用了，查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.80,0:45:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你想控制我？ - 他是想
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.80,0:45:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我想帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.60,0:45:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我？我有问题吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.30,0:45:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绝对没有 - 埃里克，闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.20,0:45:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，查尔斯，这次不行 你总是拖她后腿
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.40,0:45:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你自己好，琴
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.60,0:45:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别进到我意识里来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.00,0:45:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要进去 - 教授说他能应付
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.00,0:46:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我，琴，我能帮你，看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.00,0:46:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我意识里出去
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.80,0:46:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你也许该听她的，查尔斯 - 你一定要相信我，你对所有人都很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.70,0:46:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我能帮你 - 我猜你是想给她解药
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.20,0:46:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看斯科特，你杀了你所爱的人 因为你没能控制你的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.50,0:46:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！别说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.30,0:46:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.50,0:47:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴，让我进去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.60,0:48:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，琴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.50,0:48:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.40,0:49:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让它控制你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.80,0:49:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.30,0:50:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.80,0:50:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.10,0:50:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.70,0:50:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们生活在黑暗的时代
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.90,0:51:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐慌遍布四野，仇恨与偏见
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.50,0:51:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但每个时代， 都会有人挺身反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.90,0:51:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯·泽维尔生于一个破裂的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.20,0:51:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个他试图治愈的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.60,0:51:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他却无法看到成功的那一天了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎伟人的命运 就是无法亲身成就他们的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.50,0:51:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯不仅仅是一位领袖， 他更是一位良师，一位益友
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.50,0:51:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们害怕时，他给与我们勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.00,0:51:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而当我们孤单时，他给与我们家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.60,0:51:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人虽已逝，但他的谆谆教诲 将长存于我们心中
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.70,0:51:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论我们身在何方 必将永远铭记他的理想
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.30,0:51:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界大同的理想
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.50,0:52:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,基蒂
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.40,0:52:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.30,0:52:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？ - 还好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.50,0:52:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过…泽维尔当时来我家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.10,0:52:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他说服我来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.90,0:52:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.10,0:52:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的感觉都一样 - 不，鲍比，不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.40,0:52:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有小淘气而我…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.40,0:52:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是有些想家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.20,0:52:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,家乡的冬天
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.10,0:53:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 基蒂，起来，跟我来 - 暴风女让我们待在自己房里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.50,0:53:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，我们不会被抓到
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.20,0:53:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说，你能穿墙，是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.90,0:53:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.50,0:53:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也能变成家乡
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.10,0:54:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，鲍比
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.40,0:54:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我送你吗，孩子？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.60,0:54:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.70,0:54:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.30,0:54:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会明白害怕自己的超能力 害怕接近任何人是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.10,0:54:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.60,0:54:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望能去触摸别人，洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.30,0:54:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥抱，握手
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.90,0:54:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.00,0:54:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你这么想不是为了某个男生
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.30,0:55:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想走，就走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.60,0:55:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你真的想清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.80,0:55:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是该劝我留下？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.60,0:55:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,上楼打开行李
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.80,0:55:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你父亲，我是你朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.20,0:55:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想我的话，小淘气
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.20,0:55:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.00,0:55:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.10,0:56:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我们初次见面？ 知道我从你身上看到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.60,0:56:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了我跟查尔斯都梦想 找到的更深层次的进化
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.10,0:56:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问自己：“查尔斯为什么想把 这么一个女神变成凡人？”
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.00,0:56:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能控制这里面的金属
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.00,0:56:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你能控制一切
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.60,0:56:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能想到的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.50,0:56:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.70,0:56:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.70,0:56:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.60,0:56:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才很像他
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.90,0:57:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴，他想拖你后腿
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.00,0:57:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想怎样？ - 我想你做你自己
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.90,0:57:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺其自然
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.90,0:57:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药是针对我们所有人的 如果我们想要自由，就该奋起反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.40,0:57:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就开始反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.30,0:57:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不该跟我们在这
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.10,0:57:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她的能量一点不稳定 - 这要看在谁手里了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.00,0:57:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你信任她吗？她是他们中的一员 - 你以前也是
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.60,0:57:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直追随着你，如果你给我机会 我愿意把教授干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.60,0:57:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯·泽维尔为变种人做的事 比你知道的多得多
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.70,0:57:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最大的遗憾就是 他用死换来了我们梦想的生
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.50,0:58:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在干什么？我们怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.50,0:58:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,泽维尔创办了这所学校 让学校跟他一起结束比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.20,0:58:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们会告诉学生们让他们回家 - 我们绝大多数人无处可去
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.20,0:58:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法相信，我无法相信 我们就这样放弃学校
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.00,0:58:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我知道现在不是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.80,0:58:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说这里对变种人 来说是个安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.20,0:58:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经是，孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.00,0:58:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且现在也是，我们给你找个房间
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.30,0:58:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克，告诉所有学生 学校不会关门
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.30,0:59:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,小淘气
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.20,0:59:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，小淘气
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.50,0:59:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，皮特，看见小淘气了吗？ - 看见了，她走了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.10,0:59:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.50,0:59:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.10,0:59:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洛根 - 琴？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.60,0:59:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根，我在哪儿？洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.10,0:59:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根，洛根
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.00,0:59:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洛根 - 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.40,0:59:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛根，洛根，洛根
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.60,1:00:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去哪儿？ - 你说呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.40,1:00:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她走了，洛根，她不会回来了 - 你不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.40,1:00:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她杀了教授
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.90,1:00:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是琴 我认识的琴还在那
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.10,1:00:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，你怎么就不能面对事实？
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.70,1:00:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么就不能忘了她？ - 因为…因为…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.50,1:00:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你爱她
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.40,1:00:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她做了她的选择 现在该我们做出选择了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.30,1:00:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你跟我们一边， 那就跟我们呆在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.80,1:01:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要解药！我们不需要解药！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.10,1:01:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要解药！我们不需要解药！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.60,1:01:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要解药！我们不需要解药！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.70,1:01:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要解药！我们不需要解药！
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.60,1:01:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到解药，你就能回家找爸爸妈妈了？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.30,1:01:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.10,1:01:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，知道了，你女朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.60,1:01:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜她是想要解药，真可怜
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.80,1:01:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊，冰人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.50,1:01:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,出招吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.90,1:02:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是那个老鲍比，还是不敢打架
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.90,1:02:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的袭击只是一个开始
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.30,1:02:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要解药继续存在， 我们的战争就会持续
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.30,1:02:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的城市不再安全，你们的街道不再安全 你们自己也不再安全
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.80,1:02:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而对于我的变种人同伴们 我建议
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.80,1:02:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么加入我们，要么袖手旁观
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.70,1:02:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,变种人的热血已经洒得够多了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.10,1:02:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在试图追踪他们 我们很努力
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.60,1:02:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不能让他这么为所欲为 - 我支持您，先生
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.70,1:02:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这事关国家安全了 将沃星顿实验室戒严
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.00,1:02:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要立即大规模装备解药武器
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.70,1:03:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔萨克，你必须找到万磁王 用一切必要手段阻止他
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.00,1:03:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,万磁王要战争，我就给他一场
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.40,1:03:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走，跟上
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.10,1:03:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出你的旧武器，交出所有金属
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.90,1:03:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,匕首，弹夹，狗牌
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.60,1:03:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,领取你的塑料制武器 领取你的解药弹夹
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.80,1:03:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不能有金属
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.00,1:03:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要解药！我们不需要解药！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.70,1:03:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要解药！我们不需要解药！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.80,1:03:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要解药！我们不需要解药！
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.80,1:06:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想给我们解药 但我说，我们就是解药
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.30,1:06:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,胆小懦弱，满是缺点的智人的解药
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.50,1:06:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有他们的武器
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.60,1:06:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有我们的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.70,1:06:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要将怒火化为动力 制造这世界前所未见的暴动与骚乱
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.40,1:06:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果任何变种人来阻止我们 我们就用这毒药来阻止他们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.60,1:06:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要直捣恶魔岛
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.30,1:06:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,接管解药
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.60,1:06:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁掉它的药方
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.10,1:06:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我们将所向无敌
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.00,1:07:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.40,1:07:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老远就能闻到你的臭味
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.70,1:07:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是来跟你打架的 - 聪明孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.70,1:07:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来找琴 - 你觉得我强迫她留下？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.00,1:07:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在这完全是自愿的 - 你不清楚你面对的是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.00,1:07:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚 我看到了她如何对付查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.80,1:08:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你就站在旁边看着他死去？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.30,1:08:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有她我决不离开 - 不，你会离开
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.40,1:08:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.40,1:08:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟后结集，总统先生
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.30,1:08:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有颗卫星监视 万磁王基地的行动
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.20,1:08:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么找到的？ - 她全招了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.00,1:08:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,天下莫毒怨妇心
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.30,1:09:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,正前方就是目标
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.20,1:09:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备全方位进攻
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.00,1:09:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是B1小队长 我们准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.20,1:09:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，进攻
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.50,1:09:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.90,1:09:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动，变种人！ 举起手来！举起手来！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.80,1:10:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我投降
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.40,1:10:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，总统先生，是个圈套
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.90,1:10:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他不在那，那他在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.00,1:10:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃星顿实验室，将尘归尘、土归土了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.40,1:10:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定那孩子还在里面？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.80,1:10:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们怎么过去？ 我可不会游泳
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.20,1:10:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事交给我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.30,1:10:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风女，暴风女
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.60,1:10:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来干啥？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.40,1:10:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.60,1:10:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你找到她了 - 对，她跟万磁王在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.50,1:10:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在哪儿？ - 在行动，我知道他们去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.40,1:11:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是说你看见万磁王了？ - 我们赶紧走，他们要袭击恶魔岛
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.90,1:11:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那边有一支军队守护 - 但不足以阻止他
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.40,1:11:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去换衣服
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.70,1:11:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以前竟然能穿下这个 - 如果万磁王得到了解药，我们就无能为力了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.90,1:11:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能估计下他大概有多少人吗？ - 一支军队，还有琴
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.00,1:11:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的力量有限，但她的没有 - 这只有我们六个，洛根
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.30,1:11:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，我们人数不占优
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.80,1:11:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会骗你
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.50,1:11:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去了斯科特
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.00,1:11:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去了教授
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.20,1:11:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们现在不战斗 他们为之奋斗的一切将随他们而去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.90,1:11:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让这种事发生
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.20,1:11:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.40,1:11:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就并肩战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.70,1:11:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ｘ战警
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.20,1:11:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.80,1:12:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们加入
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.30,1:12:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.40,1:12:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们准备好了 - 是，我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.50,1:12:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你准备好去做你到时该做的事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.80,1:13:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.60,1:13:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是地震
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.20,1:13:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被卡住了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.00,1:16:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯一直想建一座桥
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.50,1:16:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.80,1:16:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,后退！隐蔽！后退！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.60,1:17:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子在房子的东南角
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.70,1:17:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那好 - 把他们拿下！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.80,1:17:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,象棋里，总是小卒打头阵
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.30,1:17:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类和他们的武器
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.80,1:17:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,塑料，他们学乖了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.80,1:17:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要小卒打头阵
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.20,1:18:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准大桥
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.50,1:18:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.10,1:18:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,弧光，使用你的冲击波 毁掉那些武器
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.70,1:18:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哎呀妈呀 - 进入隐形模式
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.30,1:19:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用飞机大炮呢？ - 对抗万磁王？他能把它们捏瘪了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.50,1:19:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我们的地面部队呢？ - 半小时的路程
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.10,1:19:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那上天会帮我们
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.00,1:19:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冲他来的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.00,1:19:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再这么干了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.80,1:20:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们守住大门
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.10,1:20:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家站在一起，守住这条线
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.10,1:20:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,被判自己的同类
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.10,1:20:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.00,1:21:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不是时候
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.40,1:21:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去找到那男孩，杀了他
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.20,1:21:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,乐意效劳
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.10,1:21:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,顶住
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.70,1:21:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去找那孩子了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.80,1:21:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能先找到
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.20,1:21:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,基蒂！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.50,1:22:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.80,1:22:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再长出来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.40,1:22:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我是谁吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.40,1:22:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是圣像，贱人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.90,1:22:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪儿啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.50,1:23:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你发明的解药吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.20,1:23:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，是我
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.10,1:23:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,姑娘们
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.90,1:23:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，别，别伤害他
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.30,1:23:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别伤害他 - 让他去，我什么都没做
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.70,1:23:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静，冷静
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.00,1:23:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都会好的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.30,1:23:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你就是个政客呢 - 就如丘吉尔所言：“听到召唤…”
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.40,1:23:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，你知道我啥意思
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.10,1:23:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，求你们了，不，不，别
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.30,1:23:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.80,1:24:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕，我是来帮你的 我会带你出去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.00,1:24:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.30,1:24:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天，怎么回事？ - 在我身边你的超能力不管用
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 靠近点，好吗？ - 好
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.70,1:24:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩藏猫猫你可找错人了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.10,1:24:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁藏了，蠢猪头
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.10,1:24:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别，不
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.80,1:24:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.70,1:24:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你们，别这样 我只是想帮你们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.30,1:24:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们像是需要帮助吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.70,1:25:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候结束战斗了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.60,1:25:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.00,1:25:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快躲起来
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.20,1:25:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走，我们走 - 快走
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.90,1:25:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！快！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.10,1:26:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要并肩作战
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.20,1:26:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻就是最好的防守
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.90,1:26:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比，你能搞定你的老朋友吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.20,1:27:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.50,1:27:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴风女，我们需要点掩护
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.10,1:27:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.70,1:28:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完蛋了，鲍比
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.90,1:28:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准你该回学校再学学
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.80,1:28:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不该辍学
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.20,1:28:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.50,1:28:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.60,1:28:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,使劲点
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.20,1:28:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不长记性是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.40,1:28:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上，我长了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.40,1:29:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.70,1:29:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们中的一员？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.40,1:29:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他们想对我们做的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.80,1:29:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,都结束了，琴
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.20,1:29:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.40,1:29:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，别开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.90,1:30:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.40,1:30:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都离开这
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.90,1:30:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.10,1:30:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是干了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.00,1:31:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我能阻止她 带大家离开这
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.40,1:31:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.50,1:31:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.40,1:32:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,琴！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.60,1:32:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你还在！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.50,1:32:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你原为他们而死？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.30,1:33:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不是为他们
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.60,1:33:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.60,1:33:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.60,1:33:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.60,1:33:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.60,1:35:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.50,1:35:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.20,1:35:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.00,1:35:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是我想要的 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.10,1:35:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我想要的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.90,1:35:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.50,1:35:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好，小伙计
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.90,1:35:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为致以全民的谢意
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.70,1:35:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向大家介绍我们 新任驻联合国大使
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.00,1:35:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部美国公民在世界上的代表
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.20,1:35:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论人类还是变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.20,1:35:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉克·迈考伊博士
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.40,1:35:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,适合你，毛球
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.30,1:43:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.70,1:43:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，默瑞亚
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.80,1:44:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯
